- action(n1, "start"): Hallucinates a preliminary step; the description explicitly states "the process begins by reviewing the support request" with no prior action.
- action(n4, "End"): Hallucinates a terminal action node; the description indicates the process simply "comes to an end" immediately after communication, without an intermediate task.
- actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, n3, n4, e1]): Misidentifies the responsible party; the description assigns the tasks to "screening staff", not a generic "Default" actor.